// Accidentals an octave apart straddling the middle line must be grouped into
// DIFFERENT octaves (so they are not overstruck). This exercises the floored
// octave division in AccidentalPlacement: with C# truncating division, staff
// positions 3 (E5) and -4 (E4) both mapped to octave 0 and wrongly overstruck.
// LILYPOND-REF: lily/accidental-placement.cc acc_less / set_ape_skylines.
title "Accidental octave straddle"
octave absolute
part m { clef treble }
section Main {
  m { <eis' eis'' cis' cis''>1 | }
}
structure { Main }
score "accidental-octave-straddle" { staff m }
